    {
      "id": "about",
      "label": "About",
      "about": {
        "paragraphs": [
          "Chris Tartaro is the Sketch Director for The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon. He previously worked for MTV (Wonder Showzen, Human Giant), Comedy Central, and Adult Swim (Xavier: Renegade Angel, Fat Guy Stuck in Internet, Delocated).",
          "He won a Primetime Emmy for his work on Late Night with Jimmy Fallon.",
          "He is also one half of the band blazrdog."
        ],
